'''Thrawn's Offices''' were the personal offices of [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]]. His main office was located aboard his personal [[Star Destroyer]] ''[[Chimaera]]''.<ref name="TIE" /> He also had another office in the [[Imperial Armory Complex]]. In his offices, Thrawn often examined art and clues he had gathered in his quest to destroy the rebellion.<ref name="Databank" />

Thrawn's office was connected to a training room containing two [[DT-series sentry droid]]s. The [[droid]]s were used by Grand [[Admiral]] Thrawn to exercise and train his martial art skills,<ref name="An Inside Man" /> as he thought physical well-being directly enhanced the mental as well.<ref name="Thrawn"> [[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref>

Thrawn's office aboard the Chimaera featured two sculptures of four-[[eye]]d, [[lizard]]-like creatures called [[ysalamiri]].<ref name="BTS Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/through-imperial-eyes-behind-the-scenes-gallery|text="Through Imperial Eyes" Behind-the-Scenes Gallery}} {{C|slide 2}}</ref>

